# LocalLoop environment variables
#
# Nothing here is required to run the MVP. The app is fully functional with the
# bundled Riverstone demo dataset and the deterministic retrieval assistant.
#
# Every value below is read SERVER-SIDE ONLY (see src/app/api/assistant/route.ts).
# Never prefix any of these with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that would ship the key to the
# browser, which the product brief explicitly forbids.

# Optional: enables the language-model layer of the local assistant.
# Without it, the assistant answers from the database directly.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model used for the assistant.
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ── Production wiring (not used by the MVP build) ──────────────────────────
# These are only needed when src/lib/repo.ts is swapped for a real database.
# Keep them server-side; the browser should talk to your API routes instead.
#
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# DATABASE_URL=